{'symbol': 'GS', 'date': '2021-06-23 02:00:00', 'title': 'AIRCALL, NOW VALUED ABOVE $1BN, RAISES $120M IN SERIES D FUNDING, LED BY GOLDMAN SACHS ASSET MANAGEMENT', 'text': "NEW YORK, JUNE 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AIRCALL, A CLOUD-BASED VOICE PLATFORM HELPING COMPANIES ACROSS THE GLOBE MANAGE MILLIONS OF CUSTOMER SUPPORT AND SALES CALLS EVERY DAY, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS RAISED $120 MILLION IN A SERIES D FUNDING ROUND, BRINGING THE COMPANY'S TOTAL VALUATION TO MORE THAN $1 BILLION. THE FUNDING ROUND WAS LED BY THE GROWTH EQUITY BUSINESS WITHIN GOLDMAN SACHS ASSET MANAGEMENT, AND JOINED BY MOST OF AIRCALL'S CURRENT INVESTORS (DTCP, EFOUNDERS, DRAPER ESPRIT, ADAMS STREET PARTNERS, NEXTWORLD CAPITAL, GAIA CAPITAL PARTNERS), SHOWING THEIR RENEWED TRUST IN THE COMPANY'S VISION."}